REGIONAL REGULATION OF WONOSOBO REGENCY NUMBER 2 OF 2012

CONCERNING

SOCIAL PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

THE REGENT OF WONOSOBO,

Considering : a. that the social problems of women and children in Wonosobo Regency continue to increase and become increasingly complex, requiring comprehensive, integrated and sustainable mitigation efforts organized by the Regional Government, community and business sector;

b. that the implementation of social protection for women and children still has gaps in its handling and therefore needs to receive priority in accordance with what is needed;

c. that social affairs are a mandatory matter which is the duty and responsibility of the Regional Government, therefore regulation regarding social protection for women and children is necessary;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation of Wonosobo Regency concerning Social Protection for Women and Children;

In view of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

